  "unsorted-history": {
   "caught": true,
   "divergent_calls": 53,
   "first_caught_at_call": 95,
   "doc": "Drops ORDER BY ORDERDATE. On a real MongoDB the (username, orderDate) index\nhides this mistake, because an index scan returns rows in date order anyway,\nuntil the planner picks another plan. The natural-order hint plays that plan\nout, so the mistake is visible on every backend."
  },
